[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-GENERIC-SECTIONS
TITLE: Generic Sections

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-135
TITLE: Public Section List
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL provide a list of public section data entries upon request, as a list of headers.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A caller can request the public sections and receive each section's headers. A public section is a page data table entry for a section whose audience is public. Members-only entries are outside this list.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-136
TITLE: Public Section Data
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL provide a public section's data upon request, including that section's headers, bodies, and resources.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A caller can request one public section and receive its headers, bodies, and resources together. Members-only sections are outside this request.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-137
TITLE: Authenticated Section List
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL provide a list of the public and members-only section data entries upon request from a logged-in member, as a list of headers.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An authenticated member can request every section and receive each section's headers.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-138
TITLE: Authenticated Section Data
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL provide any section's data upon request from a logged-in member, including that section's headers, bodies, and resources.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An authenticated member can request any one section, public or members-only, and receive its headers, bodies, and resources together.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-139
TITLE: Section Modification
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL accept modification of a section by a logged-in member who has the necessary permissions, including that section's headers, bodies, and resources.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An authenticated member with the necessary permissions can change a section. The change includes that section's headers, bodies, and resources. This requirement does not name those permissions.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

