<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An authenticated member can request every announcement and receive each announcement's headers.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-145
TITLE: Authenticated Announcement Data
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL provide any announcement's data upon request from a logged-in member, including that announcement's headers, bodies, and resources.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An authenticated member can request any one announcement, public or members-only, and receive its headers, bodies, and resources together.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-146
TITLE: Announcement Modification
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL accept modification of an announcement by a logged-in member who has the necessary permissions, including that announcement's headers, bodies, and resources.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An authenticated member with the necessary permissions can change an announcement. The change includes that announcement's headers, bodies, and resources. This requirement does not name those permissions.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-147
TITLE: Public Announcement Events
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL include the data for each upcoming public event that is within that event's announcement window when it provides public announcements upon request.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A public announcement request also returns that event's data. A public event is an event whose audience is public. The announcement window begins on the event's announcement start date. This requirement does not set when the window ends, and it does not define upcoming apart from that window. Members-only events are outside this request.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-148
TITLE: Authenticated Announcement Events
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL include the data for each upcoming event that is within that event's announcement window when it provides announcements upon request from a logged-in member.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An authenticated member's announcement request also returns that event's data, whether the event is public or members-only. The announcement window begins on the event's announcement start date. This requirement does not set when the window ends, and it does not define upcoming apart from that window.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

