[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-EVENT-DATA
TITLE: Event Data

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-125
TITLE: Event Table
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store events as a table of event entries.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Each entry is one event.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-126
TITLE: Event Name
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a name for each event.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The event entry holds the event's name.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-127
TITLE: Event Date
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a date for each event as a month, a day, and a year.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The event entry holds the calendar date on which the event occurs.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-133
TITLE: Event Announcement Start
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a date for each event as a month, a day, and a year for the start of that event's announcement window.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The event entry holds the date on which announcement of the event begins. This requirement does not set when that announcement ends.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-128
TITLE: Event Time
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a time of occurrence for each event.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The event entry holds the time at which the event occurs. This requirement does not define the precision of that time.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-129
TITLE: Event Duration
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a duration for each event.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The event entry holds how long the event lasts. This requirement does not define the units of that duration.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-130
TITLE: Event Location
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a location for each event.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The event entry holds where the event occurs. This requirement does not define the parts of a location.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-131
TITLE: Event Page Reference
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a reference from each event to the page data table entry that holds that event's details.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The event's description and name are that event's details, stored in the page data table.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-132
TITLE: Event Audience
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store whether each event is public or members-only.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The flag records whether the event is available to the public or only to members.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

